{\fs32\b\cf2 Windows Security Notice}\par\par

WrightData is not yet code-signed, so Windows SmartScreen may show a warning
when you run this installer or launch the app for the first time.\par\par

{\b\fs26 How to get past the warning:}\par\par

{\b 1.}  When you see {\i "Windows protected your PC"}, click {\b More info}
at the bottom-left of the blue screen.\par\par

{\b 2.}  A {\b Run anyway} button will appear. Click it.\par\par

{\b 3.}  The installer will open. Click {\b Next} below to continue.\par\par\par

{\i You will see the same prompt the first time you launch WrightData after
installation. Follow the same two steps: More info, then Run anyway.}\par
}
